  "status_text": "One extra bit flip saves up to two gates across three light shows. With at most two NOT gates, the three schedules need seven, eight and seven gates. With a third NOT available, all three fit in six (L-lib-1325, L-lib-1358, L-meta-53148, L-meta-53150, L-meta-53154). Lean has now checked that five gates cannot fit any of the three schedules, even with unrestricted NOTs (L-lib-1399). The search can use the same light-pattern test to rule out smaller circuits on other schedules.",
